#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:105
msgid "Standards. DID Core 1.0 (W3C Recommendation). did:web and JsonWebSignature2020 (not final; approved by the owner for this work). RFC 5280. IHE VHL transactions \"Submit PKI Material with DID\" (ITI-YY1) and \"Retrieve Trust List with DID\" (ITI-YY2) describe the same steps (ballot; transaction names unverified this session)."
msgstr "标准。DID Core 1.0（W3C 推荐标准）。did:web 和 JsonWebSignature2020（非最终版；所有者已批准用于本项工作）。RFC 5280。IHE VHL 事务“Submit PKI Material with DID”（ITI-YY1）和“Retrieve Trust List with DID”（ITI-YY2）描述了相同的步骤（投票阶段；事务名称在本次会话中未经核实）。"

#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:155
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Standards. None for the process itself. In a computable DSA, ODRL 2.2 {code0} (§2.6.6) and {code1} (§2.6.7) can state what follows when a duty is not met. The dispute itself is a legal matter."
msgstr "标准。流程本身没有标准。在可计算 DSA 中，ODRL 2.2 的 {code0}（§2.6.6）和 {code1}（§2.6.7）可以说明义务未履行时的后果。争议本身属于法律事项。"

