msgstr "其他流程在哪里 {#elsewhere}"

#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:50
msgid "WHO's trust list, published as did:web DID documents and fed by the Trust Network Gateway"
msgstr "WHO 的信任列表，以 did:web DID 文档形式发布，并由信任网络网关提供数据"

#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:143
msgid "X.509 certificate: revoke it and publish a CRL (RFC 5280 §5). This guide advises CRLs over OCSP for privacy (<a0>Certificate Governance</a0>)."
msgstr "X.509 证书：撤销证书并发布 CRL（RFC 5280 §5）。出于隐私考虑，本指南建议使用 CRL 而非 OCSP（<a0>证书治理</a0>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:100
msgid "X.509: RFC 5280 path validation to the accepted root."
msgstr "X.509：按 RFC 5280 进行到所接受根的路径验证。"

#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:94
msgid "X.509: the CA issues the certificate."
msgstr "X.509：由 CA 签发证书。"
